{"name": "Anomaly Control Simulator", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Anomaly Control Simulator, \u00a0you become an employee of a secret bureau for anomaly control. Every day, dozens of them pass through your department disguised as ordinary objects while breaking the laws of physics, logic, and reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/9a07312863b2eb4e003a0f8d9a6b894b.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/9a07312863b2eb4e003a0f8d9a6b894b.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/9a07312863b2eb4e003a0f8d9a6b894b.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>It's dangerous to go alone! Take this\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Examine artifacts with specialized equipment. Uncover dangerous properties, run tests, and decide the fate of each anomaly. And don't worry if you fail. You'll be very easy to replace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/0da17b3f5580b15b762a6d26c7d92b45.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/0da17b3f5580b15b762a6d26c7d92b45.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/0da17b3f5580b15b762a6d26c7d92b45.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The ends justify the means</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The job must get done, even at the cost of a life. If not yours, then someone else's. Run experiments with people to uncover the dangerous properties of anomalies and make the right call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/1da99fa041b612a8bc9234eb05c5417f.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/1da99fa041b612a8bc9234eb05c5417f.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/1da99fa041b612a8bc9234eb05c5417f.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Keep an eye on the world's chaos level</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think hard about what to do with each anomaly. The fate of the world depends on whose hands it falls into!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/8683c23a7000f78b487abd17c24a5cdc.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/8683c23a7000f78b487abd17c24a5cdc.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/8683c23a7000f78b487abd17c24a5cdc.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A man's home is his castle</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your workspace to improve efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/8d4fab76c429a3ce2e87072fd17d5014.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/8d4fab76c429a3ce2e87072fd17d5014.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/8d4fab76c429a3ce2e87072fd17d5014.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sometimes they break loose</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A containment breach is no reason to stop working. Contain them at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/3d73b00bd0d76d22412eee333b3977e8.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/3d73b00bd0d76d22412eee333b3977e8.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/3d73b00bd0d76d22412eee333b3977e8.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Not every threat looks like a monster</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of artifacts hide monstrous danger inside and only you stand between them and the world. Don't let us down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/26b82ee5857bb0720a5ae533c77e1e2d.poster.avif?t=1784107973\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/26b82ee5857bb0720a5ae533c77e1e2d.webm?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/extras/26b82ee5857bb0720a5ae533c77e1e2d.mp4?t=1784107973\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Papers, Please in an SCP-inspired setting. You're an agent of a secret anomaly control bureau. Examine dangerous artifacts, conduct experiments and decide their fate. Keep the world from descending into chaos.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4663760/d0a5d746b4b84b4e9d2de12ec34cf5e3c8bc5cdf/header.jpg?t=1784107973", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Simulation", "Singleplayer", "Choices Matter", "First-Person", "Realistic", "3D"], "developers": "Mind \u0421reations", "publishers": "Mind \u0421reations", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4663760", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "9 July 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/NMei_P55WpU", "first_seen": 1783548000.0, "review_rank": 309}